{
  "about": "AI label answers and the details each app marks as \"Estimated by AI\" (LabelSources in CaveKit, AiLabelSources in the Kotlin core). A detail is an estimate when its source is \"knowledge\" (ignoring case and spaces); the drinking window (drinkWindow) is never printed on a label, so it is always one. No sources, another value or a label source: not marked. Read by LabelSourcesTests.swift and LabelSourcesTest.kt.",
